  "_comment": [
    "Ticket (docs/commerce_PRD.md §4.11): one unit of a confirmed order line. READ-ONLY here: this package's services write",
    "it. The seller sees the CURRENT holder only (round 5): a transfer or resale erases the previous holder from the ticket.",
    "The secret's verifier (SecretSalt/SecretHash) and the presence history are deliberately NOT declared, so no generic",
    "page or export shows them; RavenDB keeps the undeclared fields.",
    "",
    "HAND-AUTHORED. Ids are UUIDv5 of 'ticketing-tickets:Ticket[...]', written by 'npm run stamp:library-model-ids'."
  ],
